{{!-- Hash parameters: rows, what the seed deletes (users and posts when omitted), and script, the seed path (the db package or the project root when omitted). --}}
`{{runScript "db:seed"}}` runs `{{#if script}}{{script}}{{else}}{{#if (hasPackage "db")}}packages/db/scripts/seed.ts{{else}}scripts/seed.ts{{/if}}{{/if}}`, which deletes all {{#if rows}}{{> seed/rows rows=rows}}{{else}}users and posts{{/if}} before it inserts its sample rows: an account you created yourself is lost, so run it on a development database only.
